    "start": 43.8,
    "end": 45.55,
    "text": "And let yourself go"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-013",
    "section": "Pre-chorus",
    "start": 45.55,
    "end": 48.2,
    "text": "Is that a compromise?"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-014",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 50.1,
    "end": 52.42,
    "text": "So, what do you wanna do?"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-015",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 52.42,
    "end": 53.95,
    "text": "What's your point of view?"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-016",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 53.95,
    "end": 55.5,
    "text": "There's a party, screw it"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-017",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 55.5,
    "end": 57.05,
    "text": "Do you wanna go?"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-018",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 57.05,
    "end": 58.6,
    "text": "A handshake with you"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-019",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 58.6,
    "end": 60.4,
    "text": "What's your point of view?"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-020",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 60.4,
    "end": 61.73,
    "text": "I'm on top of you"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-021",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 61.73,
    "end": 63.15,
    "text": "I don't wanna go"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-022",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 63.15,
    "end": 66.2,
    "text": "'Cause I really wanna stay at your house"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-023",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 66.2,
    "end": 69.18,
    "text": "And I hope this all works out"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-024",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 69.18,
    "end": 72,
    "text": "But you know how much you broke me apart"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-025",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 72,
    "end": 74.6,
    "text": "I'm done with you, I'm ignoring you"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-026",
    "section": "Chorus 1",
    "start": 74.6,
    "end": 76.25,
    "text": "I don't wanna know"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-027",
    "section": "Verse 2",
    "start": 130.1,
    "end": 140,
    "text": "And I'm aware that you were lying in the gutter"
  },
  {
    "id": "SH-028",
    "section": "Verse 2",
